flowchart LR
  D[CIFAR-10 train split 45k] --> T[FP32 ResNet-34 teacher]
  D --> S[ResNet-18 student]
  T --> K[Teacher logits, eval and frozen]
  S --> Q[Per-channel symmetric TWN QAT]
  Q --> L[Strict ternary Conv/FC deployed weights]
  K --> KD[Temperature-scaled KD]
  L --> KD
  KD --> V[Validation-only model selection]
  V --> C[Reload and ternary verification]
